        "TileImage": "$($repository 463750a2-6355-44e3-98c7-191619dff816).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Five individuals have gathered at Bangkok&apos;s Himmapan Hotel to finalize the sale of stolen intelligence. A meditation guru serves as their courier, a pianist&apos;s assistant handles encrypted exchanges, and two security officers protect the operation. Their financier, Roxana Franklin, has built her husband&apos;s fortune through blackmail and corporate espionage. The exchange is imminent. Our client demands immediate elimination. No discretion necessary, 47. One rifle, five targets.",
